s 2
f 8/8 10/10 9/9
f 8/8 11/11 10/10
f 8/8 12/12 11/11
f 8/8 13/13 12/12
f 8/8 14/14 13/13
f 8/8 9/9 14/14

# Side walls (material 1 - periferal)
